{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "7c432d50c6c1808ad2831d559b21b71e7dba6915d31a008acb8389821a41efcf", "ja": "ネオンがピカピカ！　バイブスアゲアゲ！\nプールサイドで飲むトロピカルジュース……！", "zh": "霓虹灯闪闪发光！气氛嗨起来！\n在泳池边喝热带果汁……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "f34bd441a5b56c38abeadf69df42bb1cb778dd9111dc0ef339f7e4135c491b92", "ja": "あっ！　なんだか創作意欲も湧いてきたかも！\nセクシーで大人な水着……自分用に作っちゃおうかな？", "zh": "啊！感觉创作的灵感也涌上来了！\n要不要给自己做一件性感又成熟的泳装呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aae6a281fe267f622bc9d5f90de89b25e45b9ae7269fa38e5f2ccb469a9cfa48", "ja": "あれ？　青羽さん、なんだか楽しそうですね。\n水着がどうかしましたか？", "zh": "咦？青羽小姐，您好像很开心啊。\n泳装怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "b8f1fb9de8deeac0c0e89bd3bd19fc701d7a9b47bdc1091cf1a4f183cde5f536", "ja": "はっ！　{$P$}さん、\n聞いてください！　この夏、私はアゲアゲでいきます！", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生，听我说！这个夏天，我要嗨起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5979348037acef838dc92f69aa80dd1b956957eb5ae5604a3c10ee0104a0c65d", "ja": "アゲアゲ……いいですね！\nやっぱり夏は楽しんでいかないと。", "zh": "兴致高涨……不错！\n果然夏天就得好好享受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "9dd209db2a6b6ec12768bc25c33a24b1d8fcddb0906804c1838f9f0426052bf0", "ja": "はいっ！　{$P$}さんもぜひ……\nん？　{$P$}さんといえば……。", "zh": "好的！{$P$}先生也请务必……嗯？说到{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "ac4b99c5ccdeae1bd77a4f620d1805771da40633d6d3e3bfb989ab5eebee950f", "ja": "そうだ、社長さんがお呼びでしたよ！\n真夏のバイブスのせいで忘れるところでした。", "zh": "对了，社长刚才叫您过去！  \n要不是盛夏的氛围，我差点就忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b146833de93029813818b839cf70f6ab209633764547cd4f1333cda3357eb7c2", "ja": "なるほど、上げすぎにも注意が必要なんですね。\nありがとうございます、早速行ってきます！", "zh": "原来如此，提升得太高也需要注意啊。\n谢谢您，我这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "beacd09d95bb52baaad84aa3570ccfe09aa80cee016845ad4726a30b15fc5bde", "ja": "はーい！　行ってらっしゃ～い♪\nふぅ、危ない危ない……。", "zh": "好——！路上小心哦～♪\n呼，好险好险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "27d90de173d5ae69c844e9f5d16c339068bc8e4019debb8305c0ef720a9a791b", "ja": "社長、音無さん！　お疲れ様です！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐！辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "8251398b0b61198a9e0dda91c10f7a6855552aed6d10e2e129c74c3bc18dede0", "ja": "おお、君！　暑い中よく来てくれたね。さ、座って\n座って。そこだとクーラーが当たらないだろう？", "zh": "哦，是你啊！这么热的天，辛苦你过来了。来，坐吧。\n坐吧。坐在那里不是吹不到空调吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "4d47cd536aa6f4967181e58ada39860debd598d5c14a66a99744a9cb5e0ec0c1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です♪\nフレッシュなトロピカルジュースですよ。どうぞ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了♪\n这是清爽的热带果汁，请用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "eae97628e7172be6356a0962400b134e4c9d27f4e206873a5b89491b73d16e19", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nとても夏らしい感じですね。", "zh": "谢谢！\n很有夏天的感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "b3e5625bd1aded7327bf13aedec7b7e012d89ef3783cba3ade44dc31e69322a5", "ja": "そう、『夏』！　今日君を呼んだのは、\n他でもない……夏のせいだ！", "zh": "没错，就是“夏天”！今天叫你来，正是因为……都是夏天的错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6a5710b76bd009cd99b2f90067f9dc1ad566d1ba8523d0586ef18091232259fc", "ja": "……はい？", "zh": "……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "5d5900a5313c2cff1d956453931749a65f355681f1bf60e0d32f03e7009da90c", "ja": "社長、それじゃよくわかりませんよ！\nちゃんとあの話をしなくっちゃ！", "zh": "社长，这样说我听不明白啊！\n那件事得好好说清楚才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "8fc601ac8b48b1c2d36b3193f37342514f3dbc93626cbcb9961a442acdcdd874", "ja": "おっと、いけない。\nはははっ、私も浮かれているのかな！", "zh": "哎呀，糟糕。\n哈哈哈，我是不是也有点兴奋过头了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0bfc773a3a93b57adf65cf5896926e809b4ef5916c24e7b7bf25187ff281f1a0", "ja": "『夏』……もしかして、\n夏らしいイベントの話でしょうか？", "zh": "“夏”……难道是指与夏天相关的活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "933d56ea6535e8f5e6c360c6f302645c1a8d5515d31de926e051ff633858419f", "ja": "うむ、まさに！　新しくオープンする大人向け大型\nプール施設と、765プロのコラボが決定したのだよ！", "zh": "嗯，正是如此！已经决定由765事务所与新开业的大型成人游泳设施进行联动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "35109fc05c41ac371f3c226de578854421ed80a96dd99f7981f81a76c264fbf1", "ja": "おおっ……！", "zh": "哦哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "263d0e7ab58059ad66424ee9f34a911ae2b6f372db0ffc2b0d1cd91fe92e7013", "ja": "そこで、我が事務所のアイドル諸君が、\n一夜限りのナイトプールパーティーを開催する。", "zh": "因此，本事务所的偶像们将举办一场仅此一夜的夜间泳池派对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "0a82056ac8aabdae64ba225c79d96cd79cc4f3d53c2e25de8933825801fe426e", "ja": "その模様をファンの皆さんにお届けし、\n施設の魅力や楽しみ方を、余す事なく紹介してほしい！", "zh": "将那副模样传达给各位粉丝，\n将设施的魅力与游玩方式毫无保留地介绍给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "76c964c1fbae4e676c87450eb160e17f66f9f03e695007a6368e40bc6944a038", "ja": "待ってください！　プールという事は、\nアイドルのみんなは……水着ですか？", "zh": "请等一下！既然是泳池，\n那偶像们……是要穿泳装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "523128ec89831e1b8de57d51ed9cdf6fb94c4b07b0cfd27a6d3ca92b63caed98", "ja": "うむ！　そうなる！", "zh": "嗯！就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "05575934876329963159299018eda4d0faaa61e77ba131454eb7f9b6bd0c1301", "ja": "なるほど。大人な雰囲気漂う会場、水着……。\n普段とは少し違うアイドルの表情を見せられそうです。", "zh": "原来如此。现场弥漫着成熟的氛围，还有泳装……  \n看来能让大家看到偶像们与平时稍有不同的表情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "370f27208ea36ccf1f936a83319d9d7666cee8a4d95c83291ede4f7f60c3e685", "ja": "しかも生配信なんですよね、社長？", "zh": "而且还是直播对吧，社长？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "82594770731c3476275cae537ea5ed5b0ae8fb209a13dad040bdfac03015455c", "ja": "うむ！　フレッシュな生配信だ！", "zh": "嗯！很新鲜的直播！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "0187db8c759eb8b6d896da8d1a5427e949dddf83790262dc067a835732ec4ab8", "ja": "生配信……。全員水着ですし、\nハプニングには、十分気を付けないとですね。", "zh": "直播……大家还都穿着泳装，所以一定要格外小心，避免发生意外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "1bbf35a95379492c018142c0a00ad804e1f2273fc5a39484cbe400e53ea5a6e9", "ja": "まあ、君の手腕ならハプニングでさえも\n楽しいバイブスに変えてくれるだろうな。ははは！", "zh": "以你的本事，就连突发状况也能变成愉快的氛围吧。\n哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "b014b35c269309a7ff1d124d4baf14a1473fd825df119c25aeef74ff3bbe4f33", "ja": "うっ、ハードルが……。\nご期待に沿えるよう、頑張ります！", "zh": "呃，难度……。\n我会努力不辜负您的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "2ce382857e680e7cb52204fe3c8ee3a71d087a75b8c3d9d32b5a382837b1e708", "ja": "うむ！　ではドーンとやってしまってくれ！\n期待しているよ！", "zh": "嗯！那就轰轰烈烈地大干一场吧！\n我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "358989f42464428d5947cb273ffc508fd54449457d1b7ec8cc7e5109bc0feb7a", "ja": "（まさに夏にうってつけの企画だな。施設の魅力が\n画面越しでも伝わるよう、アゲアゲで行こう！）", "zh": "（真是非常适合夏天的企划啊。要让大家隔着屏幕也能感受到设施的魅力，就热热闹闹地上吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
